id: pm-github-ullj
title: Refresh only already-linked GitHub items without importing new ones
description: "Select explicit existing provenance, fetch linked issue numbers in GraphQL batches, reuse import lifecycle mapping, and apply audited update-only SDK transactions. Prove selection, zero creation, real lifecycle dates, missing reasons, dry-run immutability, and batch splitting."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: changelog-unreleased,github,refresh
created_at: "2026-10-19T16:13:56.599Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T18:57:35.673Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T18:57:32.566Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T18:57:32.566Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: "Reverified main eebda9277e52 (unchanged since audit): [PR #154](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/154) (c651421) adds already-linked-only refresh, batch fetches and audited update-only mutations. Retained evidence: import-fidelity.ts, index.ts, refresh.ts."
comments[47]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T16:14:11.328Z",codex-agent,"Plan: reuse prepareGithubImport, source lifecycle projection and importGithubAtomic. Refresh selects explicit tag or github_url identities before transport, batches at 100, and supplies a guarded update-only transaction mode with native audit comments. Real tracker tests fake only HTTP; live acceptance uses scratch copies only."
  "2026-10-19T16:20:35.265Z",codex-agent,"Implementation uses shared import preparation, shared source-metadata projection, and guarded SDK update transactions. Dry-run acceptance exposed that complete-list SDK reads populate runtime caches; preview reads now use disposable copies so the selected tracker is byte-identical. The pinned SDK exposes no cache-write suppression option; this SDK UX limitation will be reported in the final summary."
  "2026-10-19T16:28:14.213Z",codex-agent,"Live read-only acceptance used independent tracker copies and the built CLI with --dry-run --json. Repository unbraind/pm-cli: selected 42, updated 42, unchanged 0, missing 0, created 0; 5 entries include status changes. Repository unbraind/pm-csv: selected 1, updated 1, unchanged 0, missing 0, created 0; 1 includes a status change. These current copies differ from the incident estimate; source-metadata backfill accounts for many planned changes. No refresh writes were applied to either original tracker."
  "2026-10-19T16:28:31.208Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof for zero creation: in an isolated source copy, reverting only the update-only suppression of the deterministic import upsert made the real-tracker guard regression fail, exit 1: actual mutations create+update versus required update only. The production source was never reverted."
  "2026-10-19T16:29:03.523Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral selection revert proof: in an isolated source copy, removing repository scoping from tag selection made the real-tracker only-linked regression fail, exit 1: actual selected/updated count 2 versus required 1. Together with the deterministic-id create-guard mutation proof, both negative controls fail for the intended behavior; unchanged production functions pass the focused 3-test run."
  "2026-10-19T16:31:14.342Z",codex-agent,"PM CLI limitation: storing timeout_seconds on the linked test was refused because the declared >=2026.10.5 host range cannot guard item format 2. No host pin or format was changed. Run-time --timeout 600 provides the bounded execution budget without persisting that guarded metadata."
  "2026-10-19T16:41:36.760Z",codex-agent,"Verified linked acceptance command: pm test pm-github-ullj --run --progress --timeout 600 passed with exit 0; all 10 real-tracker tests passed, zero failed/skipped, no timeout. The bounded batch fixture uses the SDK imported-document writer with complete valid metadata, while all behavior under test uses the production refresh command and real SDK. Current source type checks and lint also pass."
  "2026-10-19T17:25:50.874Z",codex-agent,"Isolated-home npm run release:check passed, exit 0: 933/933 tests, zero failed/skipped, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across all 16 authored modules (10730/10730 lines and statements, 285/285 functions, 3353/3353 branches), zero production audit findings, zero duplication at the unchanged gate, changelog check and release-publish attestation passed. Refresh help now describes ascending linked-number selection rather than inheriting import-specific limit wording; built CLI help is asserted. The required Bun gate is running on the final source."
  "2026-10-19T17:34:59.872Z",codex-agent,"Read-only preview clarification: all 5 companion status changes are terminal-disposition corrections under the shared importer rules: 4 closed -> canceled and 1 canceled -> closed. There are no remaining active -> closed transitions in that copy. The single CSV status change is blocked -> closed. Aggregate updated counts include source-metadata and label/title backfill; no preview was applied."
  "2026-10-19T17:42:12.226Z",codex-agent,"Final validation: isolated-home bun run release:check passed, exit 0, with 933/933 tests and zero failures/skips. Exact all-source coverage is 100/100/100/100 across 16 authored modules: 10730/10730 lines and statements, 285/285 functions, 3352/3352 branches. npm and Bun packed the same artifact hash, 39b90c2008e82c607d39cbc1c1a06c68d8b588b0. Both production audits, unchanged duplication/privacy gates, changelog checks and attestation checks passed. Strict tracker health passed with no history drift; six existing stale-in-progress advisories remain outside this feature. Ready for PR Refresh already-linked GitHub items without importing new ones; keep this item in progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-19T17:48:13.431Z",codex-agent,"Orchestrator idempotency review: inspect field deltas on a fresh companion-tracker copy, preserve genuine source refreshes, normalize representation-only comparisons, and prove immediate second apply changes zero bytes and no history lines. Trace dry-run SDK cache writes without changing upstream. Run both unchanged full release gates and behavioral normalization revert proof before pushing."
  "2026-10-19T17:51:31.496Z",codex-agent,"Copy-only field audit reproduced 42 selected/42 updates: 5 disposition corrections and 37 non-status refreshes. All 37 backfill missing GitHub metadata and genuine source creation dates; 34 also fill closure lifecycle/reason, 14 change tags, 7 change titles. Example issue 450: created_at 2026-08-22T17:04:29.745Z -> 2026-07-05T16:07:39Z; github_updated_at absent -> 2026-08-22T18:43:12Z; closed_at absent -> 2026-08-22T18:43:12Z. Preserve these genuine refreshes. Direct listAllComplete({includeBody:true}, {pmRoot,cwd:pmRoot,noExtensions:true}) writes runtime/metadata-cache*.json and runtime/metadata-query-index.sqlite; isolated refresh dry-run changed zero files. Extend read isolation to no-op applies and normalize timestamp instants plus tag sets."
  "2026-10-19T17:52:38.352Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral normalization revert proof: an isolated source copy retains the real-tracker apply/reapply tests and cache isolation; removing only timestamp normalization makes both plain and atomic regressions fail on updated=1 versus required 0 (ERR_ASSERTION, exit 1). Restored normalization passes 2/2. Baseline live second apply reported 0 updates/42 unchanged but rewrote 8 SDK runtime cache files; isolating all planning reads fixes that byte-level defect. Built CLI cold-copy dry-run with zero fixture links exits 0 and changes zero files; the nonempty live preview also changes zero files. New regressions verify immediate byte identity, unchanged history lines, equivalent timestamp/tag/title representations, and genuine github_updated_at movement."
  "2026-10-19T17:55:48.458Z",codex-agent,"Tag audit correction: 14 of the 37 non-status entries initially had tag diffs, but 7 are REST/GraphQL bot-login spelling churn (codefactor-io[bot] versus codefactor-io), not label membership changes. Refresh now requests author.__typename and projects Bot logins to the REST spelling, suppressing those seven tag writes. The remaining seven tag diffs and seven title diffs are real content changes. All 37 still require genuine source metadata/creation backfill. The source finalizer now skips normalized no-op fields during real refreshes too. Superseded the first in-flight npm diagnostic after this finding; final-source gates will run from the start."
  "2026-10-19T17:58:47.338Z",codex-agent,"Final-source fresh-copy live proof passed: first atomic apply selected 42 and updated 42 with zero creates/missing. The immediate second apply reports updated=0, unchanged=42, created=0, missing=0. Buffer.equals compared all 2561 files under the copy tracker, with zero byte differences and no added/removed files; history stayed 6265 lines. No cache priming intervened. Only seven real tag membership changes remain; seven bot spelling deltas are suppressed. Linked suite passes 13/13 with zero failures/skips/cancellations. Bot-projection-only revert fails its real-tracker regression with ERR_ASSERTION; normalization-only revert fails both plain and atomic regressions. Both final full release gates are running on identical source in separate validation directories."
  "2026-10-19T18:01:28.649Z",codex-agent,"Built CLI nonempty dry-run proof passed on a fresh cold companion-tracker copy: pm github refresh unbraind/pm-cli --dry-run --json selected 42, planned 42 updates, created 0, missing 0, exited 0, and changed zero files including runtime files. Direct SDK list reads still populate caches; refresh confines those SDK writes to disposable planning copies. Source/test/config byte comparison between the npm and Bun gate directories matches all 112 files (SHA-256 e779570b70b85cc26817d501ce7544595e259296c03b72ec989bccfb2ce0668a). Full gates remain in progress; no upstream issue or review-thread action was made."
  "2026-10-19T18:10:46.624Z",codex-agent,"Implementation commit facc65b983d1a087a7e957f48864f65e18494b31 is source-complete. A fresh git clone --no-local checkout with a clean npm ci passes isolated-home pm health --strict-exit --json and pm validate --json, both ok=true. The implementation history remains append-only and no original companion tracker was refreshed. Both full release commands are still running; their final counters will be appended before the claim is released."
  "2026-10-19T18:44:52.358Z",codex-agent,"Built CLI apply/reapply proof also passed on a separate fresh companion-tracker copy. Exact command shape: pm --path PM_PATH github refresh unbraind/pm-cli --atomic --json, where PM_PATH selects only the scratch tracker. First apply: selected=42, updated=42, created=0, missing=0. Immediate second apply: selected=42, updated=0, unchanged=42, created=0, missing=0. Buffer.equals compared all 2587 regular files, including installed extension and runtime files; zero byte differences or file additions/removals. Total history line count is unchanged at 6265. No cache priming intervened. Full npm and Bun release gates are still progressing without reported test failures."
  "2026-10-19T18:49:26.094Z",codex-agent,"Final gates PASS at implementation source facc65b983d1a087a7e957f48864f65e18494b31: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each exit 0 with 936/936 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/TODOs, exact 100/100/100/100 across all 16 authored modules. Each covers 10742/10742 lines and statements, 286/286 functions and 3371/3371 branches, zero skipped coverage. Thresholds, source inventory, dependency pins and duplication budgets unchanged; production audit, privacy, pack, changelog and publish-attestation gates pass. Linked suite passes 13/13. Normalization-only reverts fail 2/2 cases; bot-projection-only revert fails 1/1 as intended. Final built CLI fresh-copy apply/reapply is 42 updates then 0, with all 2587 files byte-identical and history unchanged at 6265 lines. Dry-run selects 42 and changes zero files. Direct SDK listAllComplete includeBody/noExtensions reads write runtime/metadata-cache JSON files and runtime/metadata-query-index.sqlite; all refresh planning reads isolate those SDK cache writes. No upstream report or review-thread action, no merge. Releasing the claim and leaving the item in_progress for orchestrator verification. Final receipt changes only documentation and append-only tracker evidence."
  "2026-10-19T20:09:39.887Z",pi-agent,"Review round started: fetching all four unresolved review threads (release preservation in import-fidelity.ts, /pull/ link selection, label pagination guards, unfinished refresh journal recovery) and verifying each against the current source before fixing."
  "2026-10-19T22:32:39.434Z",pi-agent,"Review round findings, all four verified valid against current source and fixed: (1) importFidelityFields assigned release:undefined when fidelity.github_release was empty, so finalization deleted an existing release on every refresh of an open issue or a closure without a matching calendar tag; the release key is now spread only when GitHub supplies one, so user/tool attribution survives (an existing import regression that asserted the deletion was deliberately re-pointed at preservation). (2) refresh selection accepted /pull/ URLs but the batch query reads issue(number:) nodes and compares /issues/ URLs, so every PR-linked item was reported as not_found_or_inaccessible or transferred on every run; selection now accepts /issues/ links only. (3) label pagination read next.data.repository.issue.labels without guarding a repository or issue that vanished between requests (transfer/delete), surfacing a plain TypeError instead of a CommandError; the connection is now validated and typed failures abort. (4) an update-only transaction derives its steps and transaction id from current item state, so a crash after the steps applied and source fields finalized left linked items matching the source: the retry counted them unchanged, never called the SDK, and the durable journal stayed in applying while the command exited 0; re-deriving after a partial apply also fingerprints a new transaction id (verified empirically: a status-changing replay derived github-import-e5d96059a6b2e12f while the journal was github-import-90df3e1ae6e5786a)."
  "2026-10-19T22:32:55.122Z",pi-agent,"Recovery design for finding (4): update transactions persist their exact pre-commit plan (derived transaction id, prepared entries, ordered mutations) beside the SDK journal under transactions/pm-github/ before the SDK writes; the SDK journal itself never stores the mutation list, so that record is the only replay source. runRefresh scans transactions/sdk/ for unfinished github-import journals (status applying or compensating) whose step targets intersect the selected items and replays each from the persisted plan before the unchanged filter; the replayed journal commits without re-applying completed steps, so the audit comment is not duplicated. A dry run refuses while such a journal is open; a missing or unusable plan fails closed naming the transaction id; neither writes. Ordinary no-op refreshes stay byte-stable: plans are removed after commit and their garbage is swept only when the journal is terminal or gone; the transactions directory is gitignored tracker runtime state."
  "2026-10-19T22:33:03.120Z",pi-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs, each in an isolated source copy of the package (production source untouched, only the changed function reverted): (1) reverting only the release spread in importFidelityFields made the refresh release-preservation regression fail (ERR_ASSERTION, exit 1). (2) reverting only the /pull/ acceptance regex made the selection regression fail on deep-equal (pr item selected, exit 1). (3) reverting only the label-connection guard reproduced the reviewer's plain TypeError (Cannot read properties of null, reading 'issue') and failed the pagination regression, exit 1. (4) reverting only the resume block in runRefresh made the interrupted-refresh command regression fail (Missing expected rejection for the dry-run refusal, exit 1). Restored source passes 940/940 tests including all four regressions."
  "2026-10-19T23:01:38.294Z",pi-agent,"Linked test run passed with --timeout 600: node --test test/refresh.test.ts 17/17 and node --test test/refresh.test.ts test/import-fidelity.test.ts 69/69, both exit 0, zero failures/skips; includes the four review-round regressions and the re-pointed URL-only-owner release assertion. The default 120s pm test budget is too small for this suite (two SIGTERM timeouts at 120s before the 600s run); reporting as a pm CLI UX gap."
  "2026-10-19T23:35:54.243Z",codex-agent,"Continuing review round 1 after the previous provider stopped. Verified four unresolved threads and the latest review body; no outside-diff findings. Remote branch matches the starting head and already contains current main. Reviewing carried-over recovery plans, adding behavioural revert proofs, and rerunning unchanged npm and Bun release gates."
  "2026-10-19T23:37:38.094Z",codex-agent,"Recovery review correction: journal discovery is now read-only, preserving orphan and terminal plan bytes during previews/no-ops; unreadable journals fail closed. Replay rejects a plan whose transaction id differs from the journal. Shared bounded target selection removes the duplicate uncovered limit branch. Expanded command regression to hard-crash at both step_applied and committing with a status-changing issue, then verify original-journal completion, one audit comment and a byte-stable next run."
  "2026-10-19T23:44:47.664Z",codex-agent,Final recovery hardening also refuses an unreadable journal directory and conservatively blocks an unfinished journal whose targets cannot be extracted. These cases must not appear as successful unchanged refreshes. Added real-filesystem regressions and stopped the superseded gate runs so both final commands start again against identical frozen source.
  "2026-10-19T23:45:23.303Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proofs verified in an isolated package copy, rebuilding for each mutation: release assignment reverted -> release-preservation assertion fails (1/1); issue URL regex reverted -> PR owner incorrectly selected (1/1); label connection guard reverted -> null repository raises TypeError instead of the typed pagination failure (1/1); original runRefresh restored -> both crash-boundary regressions fail on missing unfinished-journal refusal (2/2). Independently omitting only original-plan replay leaves the original journal applying instead of committed and fails both boundary regressions (2/2). Every negative control exits 1 with the intended assertion; the package source was never reverted."
  "2026-10-19T23:56:30.900Z",codex-agent,"Linked execution update: the refresh command passed, but the combined refresh/import-fidelity command reached the 600-second execution limit without an assertion failure while both full coverage gates were running. Retrying only linked test index 2 with --timeout 1200; source, assertions and gate thresholds are unchanged. PM reported evidence_recording=false because project result tracking is disabled; explicit receipts remain in comments."
  "2026-10-20T00:04:36.836Z",codex-agent,"Final focused verification PASS: pm test pm-github-ullj --run --progress --only-index 2 --timeout 1200 exited 0; node --test test/refresh.test.ts test/import-fidelity.test.ts passed 72/72 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/TODOs (452 seconds). The independent final recovery selection passed 6/6, including both crash boundaries, unreadable journal-directory refusal and unknown-target refusal. A clean validation clone matching the implementation passes strict PM health; worktree-local health alone reported an ignored extension-host version skew. Both full release checks remain in progress."
  "2026-10-20T00:41:25.029Z",codex-agent,"Both final isolated-identity release runs completed the full test phase: npm and Bun each passed 943/943 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/TODOs. The full gate source was frozen and matching between validation copies; coverage aggregation and the remaining release checks are still pending. Thresholds, source inventory, dependency pins and duplication budgets remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-20T00:43:01.894Z",codex-agent,"Review round 1 final release gates PASS: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each exited 0 with 943/943 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/TODOs. Exact all-source coverage in both: 16 authored modules; 10953/10953 lines and statements, 296/296 functions, 3446/3446 branches, zero skipped coverage. Typecheck, build, docstrings, unchanged duplication/privacy gates, production audit, packing, changelog and attestation passed. Both package dry runs have shasum c567e636c4f08c0023933110de75984843e9e206. The 72/72 PM-linked acceptance and all five revert controls (seven intended failures) are documented in docs/refresh-idempotency.md. Releasing the claim and leaving the item in_progress for orchestrator verification; no thread replies/resolutions, merge or release publication."
  "2026-10-20T02:46:57.548Z",codex-agent,"PR #154 review round: verified all six unresolved CodeRabbit threads (KU9M, KU9O, KU9S, KU9U, KU9X, KU9Z). Latest review has no Outside diff range findings. Plan: prevalidate every recovery plan and enforce repository scope, preserve canceled close reasons, remove terminal plans on failure, clarify recovery writes and remedies, add behavioral revert proofs, self-review and run unchanged full npm/Bun gates. Branch already contains origin/main."
  "2026-10-20T02:49:54.609Z",codex-agent,"Self-review extended recovery validation to the SDK disposable semantic preview so a mismatched saved mutation payload is rejected before any selected journal writes. Terminal-plan failure cleanup is shared by fresh imports and replay. Regression scenarios cover two pending journals, malformed plans, overlapping repository links, configured journal paths/import retry guidance, recovery before request failure, canceled mutation reasons, and real SDK compensation for fresh and resumed attempts. Worktree strict health has only the pre-existing ignored-extension host version skew plus stale-item advisory; no pending merge receipts."
  "2026-10-20T02:54:12.836Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs PASS in disposable copies with rebuilds before every control. PR thread ids PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM6uKU9M: restore runRefresh -> 1 intended assertion failure; KU9O: restore buildAtomicImportMutations -> 1; KU9S: restore commitGithubImportTransaction -> 2 (fresh and resumed compensation); KU9X: remove repository guard -> 1; KU9Z: restore old recovery diagnostic -> 1; KU9U: restore unconditional README guarantee -> 1. Self-review control: remove SDK plan preview -> 1. Seven controls, eight intended assertion failures, no production source reverts. Commands: npm run build then node --test --test-name-pattern=<scenario> test/refresh.test.ts. PM-linked node --test test/refresh.test.ts passed 27/27, zero failures/skips/cancellations; four additional cleanup-error scenarios are being verified separately. Project policy disables automatic test result tracking, so receipts are recorded explicitly."
  "2026-10-20T02:56:00.001Z",codex-agent,"Restored revert-control copy passed 7/7 selected regressions. Four real-SDK cleanup-error cases passed 4/4 after correcting the failure-injection fixture to target the existing Task document. Extended compensation checks preserve an unrelated real pending journal/plan. Full npm validation was restarted against the frozen corrected tests; independent Bun validation has identical source/test/config bytes across 146 tracked files. Thresholds, dependency pins and source inventory are unchanged."
  "2026-10-20T02:57:07.114Z",codex-agent,"PM-linked cleanup command PASS: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"failure cleanup preserves\" test/refresh.test.ts ran through pm test --run --progress --only-index 3 --timeout 1200 and passed 4/4. Independent final terminal cleanup selection passed 2/2 while retaining an unrelated real pending transaction. Fresh non-local clone strict health with isolated HOME and Git identity passed (no failing findings); ordinary host health discovers a global extension version skew. Validation passed with existing advisory metadata warnings. No dependency pin or telemetry configuration changed."
  "2026-10-20T03:07:11.790Z",codex-agent,"Native Bun acceptance PASS: bun test --timeout 600000 test/refresh.test.ts passed 31/31 with zero failures (Bun 1.3.5). Final compensation revert proof repeated against the extended tests: reverting only commitGithubImportTransaction produced 2 intended assertion failures; restoring it passed 2/2. PM history prefix is byte-identical to the prior head; all new records are append-only."
  "2026-10-20T03:45:32.791Z",codex-agent,"Review round 2 full gates PASS: isolated-identity npm run release:check and bun run release:check each exited 0 with 954/954 tests and zero failures/skips/cancellations/TODOs. Both exact all-source receipts: 16 modules; 10987/10987 lines and statements, 297/297 functions, 3478/3478 branches, zero skipped. Pins, source inventory, thresholds and duplication budgets unchanged. Audit, privacy, duplication, packing, changelog and attestation all passed. Both pack shasums: 2ca3eadcc13976df612f3aa7b4f9b33933d162ab. Native Bun refresh suite 31/31; PM-linked refresh 27/27 plus cleanup 4/4. All six review findings fixed; seven revert controls produced eight intended assertion failures and restored controls passed 7/7. Full thread mapping and evidence are in docs/refresh-idempotency.md. Releasing claim and leaving in_progress for orchestrator verification; no thread reply/resolution, merge or release."
  "2026-10-20T04:37:48.089Z",codex-agent,"Review round 3: fetched all review threads and all comments (no pagination remaining). One unresolved thread PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM6uMtSj is valid: persisted fidelity bypasses preflight. Latest substantive CodeRabbit review has no Outside diff range findings. Plan: validate every finalization input before replay, add real two-journal snapshot regressions and behavioral revert proof, preserve valid empty or nullable source values, then run unchanged npm and Bun release gates."
  "2026-10-20T04:40:10.853Z",codex-agent,"Implemented fidelity/ownership preflight, including source identity, primitive types, date ordering and rejection of unexpected metadata keys. Shared source-lifetime validation with fresh imports. Positive tests accept empty/null source values and optional legacy fidelity; real SDK replay with nullable source metadata succeeds. PM-linked persisted-fidelity selection passed 2/2. First behavioral control (only validateGithubImportPlan reverted and rebuilt) failed 1/1: earlier recovery committed and invalid closure metadata reached finalization. Strengthened the regression to assert full snapshot equality before checking any diagnostic wording. Initial duplication check caught repeated date validation; extracted the shared validator without changing thresholds. PM test result persistence is disabled by existing policy; recording receipts here."
  "2026-10-20T04:41:05.871Z",codex-agent,"Final snapshot revert proof: replacing only validateGithubImportPlan with the pre-fix function in a disposable copy, rebuilding with npm run build, then node --test --test-name-pattern=\"persisted fidelity in every\" test/refresh.test.ts exits 1 (0/1 pass). It fails the full tracker snapshot assertion because replay changes tracker state before rejecting the second plan. Self-review also retained case-insensitive GitHub repository URL matching with positive coverage. Restarting the npm gate after this compatibility improvement so both final receipts use identical source."
  "2026-10-20T04:42:15.390Z",codex-agent,"Self-review found one further preflight case in the same defect class: a closed issue with an empty source closure retains the native closure date. Recovery now projects fidelity onto the current isolated item snapshot and rejects creation after that retained closure before any replay. Added this case to the two-journal byte-equality regression and positive cases for link-only owners, open lifecycle clearing and case-insensitive repositories. This second source change also required restarting release validation; interrupted attempts are not gate receipts."
  "2026-10-20T04:45:14.250Z",codex-agent,"Completed preflight self-review across fresh and recovered refresh writes. Extracted shared fidelity/finalization validation and applied it to all prepared entries before either the atomic batch or sequential per-item writes, plus direct update-only atomic calls before plan persistence. Added atomic and sequential fresh-refresh regressions: a valid first item and a later retained-native-date conflict must leave every tracker byte unchanged. The ordinary import path is unchanged. Earlier gate attempts were deliberately stopped when this additional case was identified; only completed final gates will be reported."
  "2026-10-20T04:47:01.536Z",codex-agent,"Final three behavioral revert controls on the complete source all rebuilt successfully with npm run build. (1) Restore only the pre-fix validateGithubImportPlan body, retaining its optional snapshot parameter for call compatibility: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"persisted fidelity in every\" test/refresh.test.ts exits 1, 0/1 pass, tracker-byte equality fails. (2) Remove only projected native-lifecycle validation: same command exits 1, 0/1 pass, same byte-equality assertion fails. (3) Remove only the all-entry runRefresh preflight: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"fresh refresh validates.*false\" test/refresh.test.ts exits 1, 0/1 pass, first-item no-write assertion fails. Restored functions rebuilt and node --test --test-name-pattern=\"persisted fidelity|fresh refresh validates\" test/refresh.test.ts passed 4/4. PM-linked persisted-fidelity and fresh-preflight selections each passed 2/2; source build and test typecheck pass."
  "2026-10-20T04:54:41.963Z",codex-agent,"Native Bun acceptance on the complete source: env HOME=<isolated> GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 bun test --timeout 600000 test/refresh.test.ts passed 35/35, zero failures. Independent non-local clone copied all 436 tracked inputs byte-for-byte (combined SHA-256 8bc9841dccdc6b343f1e0ee79e25b7c3a01f026c0f8e9b5a9b05aa5304aa19de), installed pinned dependencies with npm ci, and passed isolated-home strict PM health and tracker validation. Ordinary worktree health retains the pre-existing global extension host-version skew; clean clone health has no gate-failing findings. Both unchanged full release commands are running; no full-gate success is claimed yet."
  "2026-10-20T05:15:15.302Z",codex-agent,"Review round 3 complete: PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM6uMtSj fixed with shared fidelity preflight, current native lifecycle projection, and fresh all-entry preflight before the first write. Three isolated behavioral revert controls each failed 1/1 on intended byte-equality assertions; restored regressions passed 4/4. Both final env HOME=<isolated> GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check and bun run release:check exited 0: 958/958 tests each, zero failures/skips/cancellations/TODOs; exact 100/100/100/100 over 16 authored modules, 11035/11035 lines/statements, 299/299 functions, 3510/3510 branches, zero skipped coverage. Audit/privacy/duplication/pack/changelog/attestation passed at unchanged pins, inventory and budgets. Both dry-run packages have shasum 065699c7d14f076692c3970954f9f9fdd98579f3. Native Bun refresh passed 35/35; both PM-linked selections passed 2/2. Independent clone strict health/validation passed; pre-existing ordinary-host extension skew and disabled PM result persistence remain environment/policy limitations. Code/test/config inputs matched across all 146 files, SHA-256 1e9f29db520083769e5a010beeb9ab51469d9dd4647ebea0ea0ea09bc623fddc. Latest review has no Outside diff range findings; refreshed thread enumeration still has only the same unresolved thread. No thread replies/resolutions or merge. Releasing claim and leaving in_progress for orchestrator verification."
